message: "If you use this repository, please cite the accompanying manuscript."
title: "Continuous-Infusion Ceftazidime–Avibactam in Critically Ill Adults: A Narrow Dosing Window Bounded by Avibactam Exposure and Ceftazidime Toxicity"
authors:
  - family-names: Piranfar
    given-names: Vahhab
abstract: "An uncertainty-aware pharmacometric evaluation of continuous-infusion ceftazidime-avibactam in critically ill adults, showing a dosing window bounded by an MIC-independent avibactam ceiling and by ceftazidime exposure."
keywords:
  - ceftazidime-avibactam
  - pharmacokinetics
  - pharmacodynamics
  - Monte Carlo simulation
  - probability of target attainment
  - uncertainty analysis
  - antimicrobial pharmacometrics
